{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Man vs. Machine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Lacking the Human Touch"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Explain about technology and technical problems in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes an exchange of written communications about asking for and giving advice on problems with technology or gadgets through the correct use of spelling, grammar, vocabulary, level of formality, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriated to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Persuasive Writing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In a persuasive essay, the writer always uses facts to support his or her point of view."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In a persuasive essay, the writer often presents some of the claims against his or her position and then presents other arguments against these claims."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Strong adjectives and adverbs give the reader a clear and rich picture of a situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use connectors of contrast (for example: <span class=\"italic\">on one hand</span> / <span class=\"italic\">on the other hand</span>, <span class=\"italic\">thus</span>, <span class=\"italic\">therefore</span>, <span class=\"italic\">as a result</span>)  to express relationships between ideas and to combine sentences. Other connectors are used to show the beginning of a conclusion or summary (<span class=\"italic\">in summary</span>, <span class=\"italic\">in conclusion</span>)."}, {"type": "example", "content": "However, ATMs are not perfect, and they do have some disadvantages."}, {"type": "example", "content": "In summary, there is no doubt the ATM has added far more benefits than problems to our lives."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Subject and Object Relative Clauses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use relative clauses to make clear which person or thing you are talking about."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use a relative clause to replace a noun, you use <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">whose</span>, <span class=\"italic\">which</span> or <span class=\"italic\">that</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Did you see the person who just used the ATM?</span> <br/><span class=\"italic\">The police said that the robbery that happened at the bank yesterday was frightening for customers.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use a relative clause for objects."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">You shouldn't believe everything that you see on TV.</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">Have you seen those people who we met at the restaurant?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Relative Pronoun</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Use</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject or object pronoun for people\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I told you about the teller who charged me extra fees.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject or object pronoun for animals and things\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you see the mouse which was running around the kitchen?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"whose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"possession for people, animals and things\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you know that girl whose father is the bank manager?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"whom (generally very formal)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object pronoun for people (people often use who)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He was invited by the manager whom he met on the weekend.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject or object pronoun for people, animals and things (where <span class=\\\"italic\\\">who</span> or <span class=\\\"italic\\\">which</span> are also possible)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you pass me the chair that you find the most comfortable?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "John Shepherd-Barron was an inventor who had a brilliant idea in 1965. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He invented a machine that would give people money after they typed in a four-digit code number."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It is truly an example of great technology in action developed by someone whose goal was to improve our way of life."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vending machine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a machine that you put money into in order to buy food or drinks"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Taking an example from vending machines that sold snack food, he invented a machine to dispense money."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a persuasive text."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "digit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a written symbol for any of the numbers 0 to 9"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He invented a machine that would give people money after they typed in a four-digit code number."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tool"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way of doing something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Over time, the ATM has also become a tool for paying bills and transferring money."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "accessible"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to be reached or approached"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These machines are so much more accessible than a bank."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in action"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "regularly in use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is truly an example of great technology in action."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "widespread"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "common over a wide area or among many people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Today they are so widespread."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "block"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area of land surrounded by four streets in a city"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is hard to go a few blocks anywhere in the world without finding an ATM."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "claim"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "saying something is true"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to make claims in your persuasive essay."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le05ob08aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le05ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find an interesting technological invention."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a 150 to 180 word persuasive essay about the invention."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use persuasive essay structure and planning."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about advantages and disadvantages."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use connectors of contrast to argue your point."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your essay to a partner or family member."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Now, have a partner or family member ask you the following questions: <ul><li>What invention is discussed in your persuasive essay?</li><li>What is your main claim about this invention?</li> <li>What are three important points that support your main claim?</li><li>What points could some people use to argue against your main claim?</li><li>What is the main conclusion in your persuasive essay?</li></ul>"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research technological inventions online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a persuasive essay on technology."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I respond to questions about my essay."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"con